[00:27.46]Sleeping alone in the drone of the darkness
[00:27.46]在黑夜的嗡嗡声中独自入睡
[00:31.68]Scratched by the sand that fell from our love
[00:31.68]我们在爱的滋润中勉强度日
[00:35.50]Deep in my dreams and I still hear her calling
[00:35.50]梦魇不断我仍能听到她的呼唤
[00:39.84]If you're alone I'll come home
[00:39.84]要是你孤单寂寞 我会回来陪你
