[00:51.83]Owning a home with no silver spoon
[00:51.83]在家里我一直含着金钥匙长大
[00:55.44]I'm drinking champaigne like a big tycoon
[00:55.44]喝起香槟像个商界大亨那般阔绰
[00:59.52]Sooner than wait for a break in the weather
